('u', 516, 2161, NULL, NULL, 'The Crucifier was first designed as an explorer/scout, but the current version employs the electronic equipment originally intended for scientific studies for more offensive purposes. The Crucifier\'s electronic and computer systems take up a large portion of the internal space leaving limited room for cargo or traditional weaponry.\r\n\r\nAmarr Frigate Skill Bonus: 10% bonus to Small Energy Turret capacitor use and 5% bonus to Tracking Disruptor effectiveness per skill level.  ', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 150000, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
