('u', 518, 2613, NULL, 'Mjolnir Fury Light Missile', 'An advanced missile with a volatile payload of magnetized plasma, the Mjolnir light missile is specifically engineered to take down shield systems.\r\n\r\nA modified version of the Mjolnir light missile. Does more damage than its predecessor but the volatile nature of the warhead, and its powerful containment system, increase the ship\'s electromagnetic footprint when loaded and armed.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 95240, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 514, 2614, NULL, 'Mjolnir Fury Light Missile Blueprint', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 9999999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 4, 2619, NULL, NULL, 'These weapons are of superior quality to those normally found on the public market, although more expensive as well.\r\n\r\nThey are implemented with a safety net which prevents them from being used illegally in stations where most types of small arms are prohibited.  Therefore many regions do not apply the small arms ban on these weapons.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 4, 2620, NULL, NULL, X'', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 518, 2621, NULL, 'Inferno Fury Cruise Missile', 'An Amarr creation with powerful capabilities, the Inferno cruise missile was for a long time confined solely to the Amarr armed forces, but exports began some years ago and the missile is now found throughout the universe.\r\n\r\nA modified version of the Inferno cruise. Does more damage than its predecessor, but the volatile nature of the warhead, and its powerful containment system, increase the ship\'s electromagnetic footprint when loaded and armed.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 810600, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 514, 2622, NULL, 'Inferno Fury Cruise Missile Blueprint', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 9999999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 4, 2627, NULL, NULL, X'', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 516, 2629, NULL, NULL, 'The Trauma heavy missile is an old relic from the Caldari-Gallente War that is still in widespread use because of its low price and versatility.\r\n\r\nA modified version of the Trauma heavy missile. Does more damage than its predecessor but the volatile nature of the warhead, and its powerful containment system, increase the ship\'s electromagnetic footprint when loaded and armed.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 574400, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 512, 2630, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 9999999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 518, 2637, NULL, 'Inferno Precision Cruise Missile', 'An Amarr creation with powerful capabilities, the Inferno cruise missile was for a long time confined solely to the Amarr armed forces, but exports began some years ago and the missile is now found throughout the universe.\r\n\r\nA modified version of the Inferno cruise. Is great for taking down smaller ships, but velocity has to be curbed to get a better launch.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 810600, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 514, 2638, NULL, 'Inferno Precision Cruise Missile Blueprint', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 9999999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 518, 2647, NULL, 'Inferno Precision Light Missile', 'The explosion the Inferno light missile creates upon impact is stunning enough for any display of fireworks - just ten times more deadly.\r\n\r\nA modified version of the Inferno light missile. Great for taking down smaller ships, but velocity has to be curbed to get a better launch.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 95240, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 514, 2648, NULL, 'Inferno Precision Light Missile Blueprint', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 9999999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 518, 2655, NULL, 'Nova Precision Heavy Missile', 'The be-all and end-all of medium-sized missiles, the Nova is a must for those who want a guaranteed kill no matter the cost.\r\n\r\nA modified version of the Nova heavy missile. Great for taking down smaller ships, but velocity has to be curbed to get a better launch.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 574400, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
