('u', 516, 3766, NULL, NULL, 'The Vigil is an unusual Minmatar ship, serving both as a long range scout as well as an electronic warfare platform. It is fast and agile, allowing it to keep the distance needed to avoid enemy fire while making use of jammers or other electronic gadgets.\r\n\r\nMinmatar Frigate Skill Bonus: 5% ship velocity and Target Painter effectiveness per skill level.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 172500, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
