('u', 4, 12251, NULL, NULL, 'Being a part of the infamous pirate group going by the name of "The Seven", Sarrah is a threat not to be taken lightly.  These scoundrels have looted countless convoys in high security space, as well as being suspects for various high profile kidnappings throughout the galaxy.  Concord has placed a high bounty on their heads.  Threat level: Very high', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 4, 12252, NULL, NULL, 'Being a part of the infamous pirate group going by the name of "The Seven", Schmidt is a threat not to be taken lightly.  These scoundrels have looted countless convoys in high security space, as well as being suspects for various high profile kidnappings throughout the galaxy.  Concord has placed a high bounty on their heads. Threat level: Deadly', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 4, 12253, NULL, NULL, 'Being a part of the infamous pirate group going by the name of "The Seven", Olufami is a threat not to be taken lightly.  These scoundrels have looted countless convoys in high security space, as well as being suspects for various high profile kidnappings throughout the galaxy.  Concord has placed a high bounty on their heads. Threat level: Deadly', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 4, 12255, NULL, NULL, 'Being a part of the infamous pirate group going by the name of "The Seven", Elena Gazky is a threat not to be taken lightly.  These scoundrels have looted countless convoys in high security space, as well as being suspects for various high profile kidnappings throughout the galaxy.  Concord has placed a high bounty on their heads. Threat level: Deadly', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 516, 12257, NULL, NULL, 'Drains energy from the target ship and adds it to your own. This is a more powerful version  designed for cruiser class ships.\r\n\r\nNote: a Nosferatu module will not drain your target\'s capacitor below your own capacitor percentage level.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 197520, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
