('u', 516, 12801, NULL, NULL, 'The Javelin charge consists of a cluster of Iridium Fletchets with a Graviton Pulse Detonator. This allows for much higher damage than can be achieved by a standard rail system. However, the inherent entropy of graviton pulses means that it is very hard to maintain accuracy at long range.\r\n\r\nCan only be used by medium tech level II+ Railguns.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 554000, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
