('u', 516, 12814, NULL, NULL, 'The Conflagration is a supercharged X-Ray crystal created by Carthum Conglomerate for the Imperial Navy. Has much greater damage potential than the standard version, but needs considerably more capacitor and also has reduced effective range. The delicate crystalline structures used in the manufacture of this advanced crystal degrade with use, eventually causing it to shatter.\r\n\r\nCan only be used by medium tech level II Pulse Lasers   ', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 289040, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
