('u', 516, 12818, NULL, NULL, 'The Scorch is a UV crystal designed by Carthum Conglomerate. Utilizing AI microtrackers, it gives a good boost to range but has fairly low damage potential and low tracking and is of limited use against heavily armored targets. The delicate crystalline structures used in the manufacture of this advanced crystal degrade with use, eventually causing it to shatter.\r\n\r\nCan only be used by medium tech level II Pulse Lasers.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 289040, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
