('u', 516, 16046, NULL, NULL, 'This multi-barrel autocannon is designed for skirmish warfare. \r\n\r\nMust be loaded with any of the following projectile ammo types: Carbonized Lead, Depleted Uranium, EMP, Fusion, Nuclear, Phased Plasma, Proton, or Titanium Sabot.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1000, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 516, 16047, NULL, NULL, 'One of the most powerful projectile cannons a battleship can equip. \r\n\r\nMust be loaded with any of the following projectile ammo types: Carbonized Lead, Depleted Uranium, EMP, Fusion, Nuclear, Phased Plasma, Proton, or Titanium Sabot.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 595840, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 516, 16048, NULL, NULL, 'The ultimate artillery cannon. It hurls death and destruction over incredible distances. \r\n\r\nMust be loaded with any of the following projectile ammo types: Carbonized Lead, Depleted Uranium, EMP, Fusion, Nuclear, Phased Plasma, Proton, or Titanium Sabot.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 744812, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 516, 16049, NULL, NULL, 'A simple but effective close combat autocannon. \r\n\r\nMust be loaded with any of the following projectile ammo types: Carbonized Lead, Depleted Uranium, EMP, Fusion, Nuclear, Phased Plasma, Proton, or Titanium Sabot.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1976, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 516, 16050, NULL, NULL, 'A powerful autocannon that can smash apart most lightly armored frigates with ease. \r\n\r\nMust be loaded with any of the following projectile ammo types: Carbonized Lead, Depleted Uranium, EMP, Fusion, Nuclear, Phased Plasma, Proton, or Titanium Sabot.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4484, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 516, 16051, NULL, NULL, 'This autocannon is designed for skirmish warfare. \r\n\r\nMust be loaded with any of the following projectile ammo types: Carbonized Lead, Depleted Uranium, EMP, Fusion, Nuclear, Phased Plasma, Proton, or Titanium Sabot.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 25888, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 516, 16052, NULL, NULL, 'This artillery is one of the most powerful weapons that can be mounted on a frigate. \r\n\r\nMust be loaded with any of the following projectile ammo types: Carbonized Lead, Depleted Uranium, EMP, Fusion, Nuclear, Phased Plasma, Proton, or Titanium Sabot.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 5996, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 516, 16053, NULL, NULL, 'Rocket-assisted artillery projectiles designed for longe-range combat. It is the most powerful projectile weapon able to be fitted onto frigates. \r\n\r\nMust be loaded with any of the following projectile ammo types: Carbonized Lead, Depleted Uranium, EMP, Fusion, Nuclear, Phased Plasma, Proton, or Titanium Sabot.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 7496, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 516, 16054, NULL, NULL, 'The 425mm is a behemoth that will inflict severe damage on most cruisers and frigates in short-range battles. \r\n\r\nMust be loaded with any of the following projectile ammo types: Carbonized Lead, Depleted Uranium, EMP, Fusion, Nuclear, Phased Plasma, Proton, or Titanium Sabot.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 44740, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 516, 16055, NULL, NULL, 'A powerful long-range artillery. One of the most damaging weapons mountable on a cruiser. \r\n\r\nMust be loaded with any of the following projectile ammo types: Carbonized Lead, Depleted Uranium, EMP, Fusion, Nuclear, Phased Plasma, Proton, or Titanium Sabot.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 59676, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 516, 16056, NULL, NULL, 'This rocket-assisted howitzer is designed for long-range bombardment. \r\n\r\nMust be loaded with any of the following projectile ammo types: Carbonized Lead, Depleted Uranium, EMP, Fusion, Nuclear, Phased Plasma, Proton, or Titanium Sabot.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 74980, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 516, 16057, NULL, NULL, 'Artillery cannon capable of causing tremendous damage. \r\n\r\nMust be loaded with any of the following projectile ammo types: Carbonized Lead, Depleted Uranium, EMP, Fusion, Nuclear, Phased Plasma, Proton, or Titanium Sabot.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 448700, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 516, 16058, NULL, NULL, 'This autocannon is a simple but effective close combat weapon. \r\n\r\nMust be loaded with any of the following projectile ammo types: Carbonized Lead, Depleted Uranium, EMP, Fusion, Nuclear, Phased Plasma, Proton, or Titanium Sabot.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 10000, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 516, 16059, NULL, NULL, 'Combines the damage output of two 425mm intermediate-range autocannons. \r\n\r\nMust be loaded with any of the following projectile ammo types: Carbonized Lead, Depleted Uranium, EMP, Fusion, Nuclear, Phased Plasma, Proton, or Titanium Sabot.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 98972, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 516, 16060, NULL, NULL, 'Powerful, intermediate-range repeating artillery cannon with a decent rate of fire. \r\n\r\nMust be loaded with any of the following projectile ammo types: Carbonized Lead, Depleted Uranium, EMP, Fusion, Nuclear, Phased Plasma, Proton, or Titanium Sabot.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 298716, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 518, 16061, NULL, 'Caldari Navy Rapid Light Missile Launcher', 'Launcher for cruisers intended to counter fast frigates, can only be fitted with regular light missiles.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4224, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 516, 16062, NULL, NULL, 'A battleship mounted launcher used for long range standoffs with other battleships, but less suitable for bombardment of deployed structures. Contains a huge missile capacity, but has a slow firing rate and trouble targeting small, fast ships. ', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 99996, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 516, 16064, NULL, NULL, 'Designed for long engagements between medium sized ships. Slow firing rate, but makes up for it with a large missile capacity.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 14996, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 516, 16065, NULL, NULL, 'A tiny launcher that can carry a very limited supply of rockets. Not really intended as a primary weapon but rather as a cheap supplementary weapon system.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 3000, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 518, 16067, NULL, 'Caldari Navy Torpedo Launcher', 'A massive launcher designed for extended bombardments of hard targets like battleships and stations. Contains a huge missile capacity, but has a slow firing rate and trouble targeting small, fast ships.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 20580, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 518, 16068, NULL, 'Caldari Navy Light Missile Launcher', 'Favored by many for its average capacity and firing rate. Useful in both fast attack raids and longer battles.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 3000, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
