('u', 516, 17656, NULL, NULL, 'Extra Large Hybrid Ammo.  Can be used only by starbase defense batteries and capital ships like dreadnoughts. \r\n\r\nConsists of two components: a shell of titanium and a core of plutonium atoms suspended in plasma state. Railguns launch the shell directly, while particle blasters pump the plasma into a cyclotron and process the plasma into a bolt that is then fired.   ', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 80000, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
