('u', 516, 17660, NULL, NULL, 'Extra Large Hybrid Ammo.  Can be used only by starbase defense batteries and capital ships like dreadnoughts. \r\n\r\nConsists of two components: a shell of titanium and a core of tungsten atoms suspended in plasma state. Railguns launch the shell directly, while particle blasters pump the plasma into a cyclotron and process the plasma into a bolt that is then fired.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 30000, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
