('u', 516, 17686, NULL, NULL, 'Extra Large Frequency Crystal.  Can be used only by starbase defense batteries and capital ships like dreadnoughts. \r\n\r\nRandomly cycles the laser through the entire spectrum. The greatly increased damage comes at the cost of a significant reduction in range.\r\n\r\nWith shorter range, Thermal damage increases and the overall damage output is increased.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4000000, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 512, 17687, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 40000000, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 516, 17688, NULL, NULL, 'Extra Large Frequency Crystal.  Can be used only by starbase defense batteries and capital ships like dreadnoughts. \r\n\r\nModulates the beam of a laser weapon into the radio frequencies. Offers greatly improved range but significantly lower damage.\r\n\r\nWith longer range, EM damage increases although the overall damage output is decreased.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 3000000, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
