('u', 516, 18068, NULL, NULL, 'The modulated deep core miner is a technological marvel that combines the capacities of the commonly used Miner II with that of the deep core mining laser. Using a modular mining crystal system, it can be altered on the fly for maximum efficiency.\r\n\r\nIt\'s important to remember, however, that without the proper crystals this unit is only marginally useful for mining mercoxit, and highly inefficient for most anything else.\r\n    ', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 617520, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
