('u', 516, 22536, NULL, NULL, 'Basic proficiency at coordinating mining operations.  Grants a 2% bonus to fleet members\' mining yield per level.  Note: The fleet bonus only works if you are the assigned fleet booster.\r\n', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 75000, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
