('u', 4, 23863, NULL, NULL, 'The eggs of the Yorak Fish are prized delicacies of the Amarrian Emperor and its house. Only those of royal blood are allowed to consume these rare eggs. Transportation of these eggs is only given to highly trusted employees and associates of Imperial Shipments. \r\n\r\nWith the complete control on the consumption of these eggs controlled by the Emperor\'s House the processing plants are often a target of raiding factions to gain a few portions of these true delicacies.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
