('u', 516, 24523, NULL, NULL, 'An ultra-heavy unguided EMP missile. While it is a slow and dumb projectile, its sheer damage potential is simply staggering.\r\n\r\nThis modified version of the Mjolnir Torpedo packs a considerably stronger punch, but as a result is heavier and slower. This makes it very effective against larger targets, but markedly less effective against smaller and more agile targets. The volatile nature of the warhead, and its powerful containment system, increase the ship\'s electromagnetic footprint when loaded and armed.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1440725, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 512, 24524, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 9999999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 516, 24525, NULL, NULL, 'An ultra-heavy unguided plasma missile. While it is a slow and dumb projectile, its sheer damage potential is simply staggering.\r\n\r\nA modified version of the Inferno Torpedo. It can reach higher velocity than the Inferno Torpedo but needs to reduce the speed of the ship to compensate.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1440725, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 512, 24526, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 9999999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
