('u', 518, 24539, NULL, 'Mjolnir Precision Cruise Missile', 'The mother of all missiles, the Mjolnir delivers a tremendous payload, guaranteed to get its victims acquainted with their personal god in a quick, but painful manner.\r\n\r\nA modified version of the Mjolnir cruise. Great for taking down smaller ships, but velocity has to be curbed to get a better launch.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 810600, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
