('u', 516, 24550, NULL, NULL, 'The ultimate expression of God\'s Divine wrath, this weapon projects a beam of the Lord\'s holy light, designed to put sinners in their proper place.\r\n\r\nNotes: This weapon can only fire on ships that are capital-sized or larger. After firing, you will be immobile for thirty seconds and will be unable to activate your jump drive or cloaking device for ten minutes.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 426658346, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
