('u', 516, 24552, NULL, NULL, 'Using a targeting and tracking control system more advanced than any other in existence, this weapon launches and controls a storm of missile fire capable of neutralizing almost any target.\r\n\r\nNotes: This weapon can only fire on ships that are capital-sized or larger. After firing, you will be immobile for thirty seconds and will be unable to activate your jump drive or cloaking device for ten minutes.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 427533154, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
