('u', 516, 24554, NULL, NULL, 'By using reverse-engineered Sleeper technology and advances in focused magnetic fields, this weapon emits a beam of antimatter that is capable of obliterating nearly anything it touches.\r\n\r\nNotes: This weapon can only fire on ships that are capital-sized or larger. After firing, you will be immobile for thirty seconds and will be unable to activate your jump drive or cloaking device for ten minutes.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 414511964, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
