('u', 516, 26410, NULL, NULL, 'This rig isn\'t supposed to be in game until a use for it is decided.\r\n\r\nOnce affixed to the controlling mechanisms of a ship\'s missile launchers, this durable and multiplexing part assumes direct control of the ship\'s launching operations. All commands are routed through it, re-calculated and optimized, with the result that both the launchers themselves and the missiles they fire are made all the more deadlier - but, naturally, at a cost. Decreases missile launcher TO BE DECIDED at the expense of increased CPU requirements for launchers.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
