('u', 17412, 28256, NULL, NULL, 'Passed on to the winners after every tournament, the magnificent Alliance Tournament cup is perhaps the most coveted prize in New Eden.\r\n\r\nGlory and fame await the holders, who had to defeat the competition posed by the elite combat teams of their opponents in the one of the most gruelling, bloody and exciting tournaments in existence. \r\n\r\n<div style="text-align:center;">HUN Reloaded\r\nYear 108 - 4th Alliance Tournament Winners</div>\r\n\r\n<div style="text-align:center;">Ev0ke\r\nYear 109 - 5th Alliance Tournament Winners</div>\r\n\r\n<div style="text-align:center;">Pandemic Legion Year 111 - 6th Alliance Tournament Winners</div>\r\n', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 38606210),
