('u', 516, 28583, NULL, NULL, 'An electronic interface designed to facilitate the deployment of the Rorqual into its industrial configuration.  Whilst in the deployed configuration, energy is channelled to the unique assembly lines which can compress asteroid ore and ice.\r\n\r\nNote: can only be fitted on the Rorqual ORE capital ship.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 37609578, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
