('u', 518, 29009, NULL, 'Targeting Range Script', 'Originally used by the adolescent hacker group The \'Fendahlian Collective\' to alter high tech security firmware, these script packs contain intricate code which modify the inherent behavior of certain modules by directly inserting commands into the firmware. The applications of such technology was not lost on the major players and the kids who invented it now head their own research divisions.\r\n\r\nThis script can be loaded into a sensor booster or remote sensor booster module to increase the module\'s targeting range bonus at the expense of the locking speed bonus.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 12192, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
