('u', 4, 30255, NULL, NULL, 'Normally synthesized at great cost, small amounts of this film are also able to be removed from the outer layers of a Sleeper drone\'s armor. When combined with other materials it has the capability to spread thermal damage out across the hull, cooling it quickly, thus minimize the incoming damage from heat-based weaponry. \r\n', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
