('u', 516, 32122, NULL, NULL, 'This implant does nothing in and of itself, but when used in conjunction with other low-grade Grail implants it will boost their effect.\r\n\r\nPrimary Effect: +40% bonus to the strength of all low-grade Grail implant secondary effects. Not cumulative with high-tier Grail implant set', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
