('u', 518, 2404, NULL, 'Standard Missile Launcher II', 'Favored by many for its average capacity and firing rate. Useful in both fast attack raids and longer battles.\n\n\n\nMust be loaded with light missiles: Bloodclaw, Flameburst, Piranha, Sabretooth, (Fury and Precision variants available) or their F.O.F variants; Exterminator, Firefly, Seeker, Serpent.\n\n', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 445569, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
