('u', 516, 2603, NULL, NULL, 'Replaces some of the heavier structure components with lighter, but more fragile material. Increases ship\'s velocity and improves maneuverability at the expense of hull strength.\n\n\n\nPenalty: Using more than one type of this module or similar modules that affect the same attribute on the ship will be penalized.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4253.94, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
