('u', 518, 2801, NULL, 'Bane Javelin Torpedo', 'An ultra-heavy unguided nuclear missile. Slow and dumb but its sheer damage potential is simply staggering.\n\n\n\nA modified version of the Bane Torpedo. It can reach higher velocity than the Bane Torpedo but needs to reduce the speed of the ship to compensate.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1339.16, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
