('u', 16932, 2905, NULL, NULL, 'This artillery is one of the most powerful weapons that can be mounted on a frigate. \n\n\n\nMust be loaded with any of the following regular and advanced projectile ammo types: Carbonized Lead, Depleted Uranium, EMP, Fusion, Nuclear, Phased Plasma, Proton, Titanium Sabot, Quake, Tremor.', NULL, NULL, 4, NULL, NULL, NULL, 566403, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 16691824),
