('u', 4, 3898, NULL, NULL, 'Congratulations, capsuleer! You have been selected to receive a free limited batch of Quafe Zero, the performance drink with the powers of a booster! Enjoy the benefits of increased reflexes with none of the drawbacks!<br><br> <font color="#FFFF00">Benefits:</font> +5% Speed, +5% Scan Resolution. Duration: 1 hour.<br><br> <i>Attached Ad Copy</i><br><br> As a capsuleer, you are immortal. You have all eternity to seize your destiny. Shouldn', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
