('u', 4, 12251, NULL, NULL, 'Being a part of the infamous pirate group going by the name of "The Seven", Sarrah is a threat not to be taken lightly.  These scoundrels have looted countless convoys in high secure space, as well as being suspects for various high profile kidnappings throughout the galaxy.  Concord has placed a high bounty on their heads.  Threat level: Very high', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 4, 12252, NULL, NULL, 'Being a part of the infamous pirate group going by the name of "The Seven", Schmidt is a threat not to be taken lightly.  These scoundrels have looted countless convoys in high secure space, as well as being suspects for various high profile kidnappings throughout the galaxy.  Concord has placed a high bounty on their heads. Threat level: Deadly', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 4, 12253, NULL, NULL, 'Being a part of the infamous pirate group going by the name of "The Seven", Olufami is a threat not to be taken lightly.  These scoundrels have looted countless convoys in high secure space, as well as being suspects for various high profile kidnappings throughout the galaxy.  Concord has placed a high bounty on their heads. Threat level: Deadly', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 4, 12255, NULL, NULL, 'Being a part of the infamous pirate group going by the name of "The Seven", Elena Gazky is a threat not to be taken lightly.  These scoundrels have looted countless convoys in high secure space, as well as being suspects for various high profile kidnappings throughout the galaxy.  Concord has placed a high bounty on their heads. Threat level: Deadly', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
