('u', 516, 12773, NULL, NULL, 'An advanced version of the standard Nuclear ammo with a Morphite-enriched warhead and a smart tracking system. \n\n\n\nCan only be used by medium tech level II+ Autocannons.   ', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 422.765, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 516, 12775, NULL, NULL, 'An advanced version of the standard Nuclear ammo with a Morphite-enriched warhead and a smart tracking system. \n\n\n\nCan only be used by large tech level II+ Autocannons.   ', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1050.81, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 516, 12777, NULL, NULL, 'The Hail is an attempt to combine the penetration of titanium sabot with the versatility of a depleted uranium shell. It consists of a fairly large titanium sabot shell with a payload of depleted uranium submunitions. It has tremendous damage potential, but should not be used at long ranges. Any pilot using this ammunition should be prepared to trade optimal range for decreased tracking speed and a devastating amount of damage.\n\n\n\nCan only be used by medium tech level II+ Autocannons. ', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 422.765, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 516, 12779, NULL, NULL, 'The Hail is an attempt to combine the penetration of titanium sabot with the versatility of a depleted uranium shell. It consists of a fairly large titanium sabot shell with a payload of depleted uranium submunitions. It has tremendous damage potential, but should not be used at long ranges. Any pilot using this ammunition should be prepared to trade optimal range for decreased tracking speed and a devastating amount of damage.\n\n\n\nCan only be used by large tech level II+ Autocannons. ', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1050.81, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 516, 12781, NULL, NULL, 'The Storm is a mixed payload submunition system, designed as a versatile all-in-one solution for any combat scenario. Consisting of three different miniature warheads (EMP, Titanium And Plasma), it is incredibly hard to counter completely with standard defensive systems. The downside is of course that individually, the warheads are much weaker than normal and it\'s rather easy to counter at least part of the damage done.          \n\n\n\nCan only be used by medium tech level II+ Autocannons.   ', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 6.73215, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 516, 12783, NULL, NULL, 'The Storm is a mixed payload submunition system, designed as a versatile all-in-one solution for any combat scenario. Consisting of three different miniature warheads (EMP, Titanium And Plasma), it is incredibly hard to counter completely with standard defensive systems. The downside is of course that individually, the warheads are much weaker than normal and it\'s rather easy to counter at least part of the damage done.          \n\n\n\nCan only be used by large tech level II+ Autocannons.   ', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 12.2321, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 516, 12785, NULL, NULL, 'The Null is an improved version of the standard Thorium charge that possesses greatly improved molecular cohesion, resulting in superior range and reduced particle dissipation.    \n\n\n\nCan only be used by medium tech level II Blasters.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 237.511, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 516, 12787, NULL, NULL, 'The Null is an improved version of the standard Thorium charge that possesses greatly improved molecular cohesion, resulting in superior range and reduced particle dissipation.   \n\n\n\nCan only be used by large tech level II+ Blasters.          ', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 587.678, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 516, 12789, NULL, NULL, 'The Void Xenon charge is a high-powered blaster charge that delivers an extremely powerful blast of kinetic energy. However, it has several serious drawbacks, most notably the fact that it requires considerably more capacitor energy than any other blaster charge. It also needs to maintain a clean aim for a slightly longer time than normal. \n\n\n\nCan only be used by medium tech level II+ Blasters.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 237.511, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 516, 12791, NULL, NULL, 'The Void Xenon charge is a high-powered blaster charge that delivers an extremely powerful blast of kinetic energy. However, it has several serious drawbacks, most notably the fact that it requires considerably more capacitor energy than any other blaster charge. It also needs to maintain a clean aim for a slightly longer time than normal. \n\n\n\nCan only be used by large tech level II+ Blasters.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 587.678, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 516, 12793, NULL, NULL, 'The Void Morphite blaster charge is Duvolle Labs\' answer to the recent advances in shield technology. Unlike most blaster charges, the Void\'s main power lies in the electromagnetic radiation generated by the plasmatized morphite. \n\n\n\nCan only be used by medium tech level II+ Blasters.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 6.73215, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 516, 12795, NULL, NULL, 'The Void Morphite blaster charge is Duvolle Labs\' answer to the recent advances in shield technology. Unlike most blaster charges, the Void\'s main power lies in the electromagnetic radiation generated by the plasmatized morphite. \n\n\n\nCan only be used by large tech level II+ Blasters.          ', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 12.2321, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 516, 12797, NULL, NULL, 'The Bolt is actualy a modified Emp Artillery warhead Encased in a standard thungsten charge casing. This results in substantialy improved penetration as the emp shock disrupts the shield allowing the thungsten scrapnel to bipass it more effectively.\n\n\n\n        \n\nCan only be used by Medium tech level II+ Railguns        ', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 6.73215, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 516, 12799, NULL, NULL, 'The Bolt is actualy a modified Emp Artillery warhead Encased in a standard thungsten charge casing. This results in substantialy improved penetration as the emp shock disrupts the shield allowing the thungsten scrapnel to bipass it more effectively.\n\n\n\n        \n\nCan only be used by Large tech level II+ Railguns      ', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 12.2321, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 516, 12801, NULL, NULL, 'The Javelin charge consists of a cluster of Iridium Fletchets with a Graviton Pulse Detonator. This allows for much higher damage than can be achieved by a standard rail system. However, the inherent entropy of graviton pulses means that it is very hard to maintain accuracy at long range.\n\n\n\nCan only be used by medium tech level II+ Railguns.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 322.999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 516, 12803, NULL, NULL, 'The Javelin charge consists of a cluster of Iridium Fletchets with a Graviton Pulse Detonator. This allows for much higher damage than can be achieved by a standard rail system. However, the inherent entropy of graviton pulses means that it is very hard to maintain accuracy at long range.\n\n\n\nCan only be used by large tech level II+ Railguns.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 801.397, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 516, 12805, NULL, NULL, 'The spike munition package is designed to deliver huge damage to targets at extreme distances. It consists of a superdense plutonium sabot mounted on a small graviton booster unit that provides a substantial boost to the sabots impact velocity.  However, the charge is next to useless at close range.   \n\n\n\nCan only be used by medium tech level II+ railguns.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 322.999, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 516, 12807, NULL, NULL, 'The Spike munition package is designed to deliver huge damage to targets at extreme distances. It consists of a superdense plutonium sabot mounted on a small rocket unit that provides a substantial boost to the sabots impact velocity.  However, the charge is next to useless at close range.   \n\n\n\nCan only be used by large tech level II+ railguns.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 801.397, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 516, 12810, NULL, NULL, 'This frequency modulation crystal uses a modified microwave crystal coupled with a relatively low energy electron beam generator to alter the electric charge of molecules causing them to violently break apart. \n\n\n\nCan only be used by medium tech level II Pulse Lasers      ', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 8712.22, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
