('u', 516, 14776, NULL, NULL, 'This prototype of an advanced cloaking mechanism was one of the last major technological breakthroughs to come out of Crielere Labs. Although it does work it is not really a finished product and has some serious drawbacks, most notably the fact that the module creates high sensor disruption while fitted and can not operate unless at minimum velocity.\n\n\n\nNote: Fitting two or more cloaking devices to a ship negates their use, as unsynchronized light deflection causes interference.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 9833970, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
