('u', 516, 15790, NULL, NULL, 'This prototype of an advanced cloaking mechanism was one of the last major technological breakthroughs to come out of Crielere Labs. Although it does work it is not really a finished product and has some serious drawbacks, most notably the fact that the module creates high sensor disruption while fitted and can not operate unless at minimum velocity.\n\n\n\nNote: Fitting two or more cloaking devices to a ship negates their use, as unsynchronized light deflection causes interference.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 9346370, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 516, 15792, NULL, NULL, 'By predicting the trajectory of targets, it helps to boost the tracking speed and range of turrets.  This module can be loaded with scripts to increase its effectiveness in certain areas. \n\n\n\nPenalty: Using more than one type of this module or similar modules that affect the same attribute on the ship will be penalized.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 183630, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
