('u', 516, 16050, NULL, NULL, 'A powerful autocannon that can smash apart most lightly armored frigates with ease. \n\n\n\nMust be loaded with any of the following projectile ammo types: Carbonized Lead, Depleted Uranium, EMP, Fusion, Nuclear, Phased Plasma, Proton, or Titanium Sabot.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 143835, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
