('u', 512, 16125, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2459290, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 516, 16126, NULL, NULL, 'This prototype of an advanced cloaking mechanism was one of the last major technological breakthroughs to come out of Crielere Labs. Although it does work it is not really a finished product and has some serious drawbacks, most notably the fact that the module creates high sensor disruption while fitted and can not operate unless at minimum velocity.\n\n\n\nNote: Fitting two or more cloaking devices to a ship negates their use, as unsynchronized light deflection causes interference.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 9178370, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 16932, 16128, NULL, NULL, 'A high-powered pulse laser. Good for short to medium range encounters. \n\n\n\nRequires frequency crystal ammo types: Gamma, Infrared, Microwave, Multifrequency, Radio, Standard, Ultraviolet, Xray.', NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 10751.1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 16682211),
('u', 16932, 16129, NULL, NULL, 'This heavy pulse laser uses two separate laser focusing systems to reduce the cool down period between shots. A great weapon for medium to long range encounters. \n\n\n\nRequires frequency crystal ammo types: Gamma, Infrared, Microwave, Multifrequency, Radio, Standard, Ultraviolet, Xray.', NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 476671, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 16682209),
('u', 16932, 16131, NULL, NULL, 'A heavy laser designed for short to medium range engagements. Delivers powerful damage. \n\n\n\nRequires frequency crystal ammo types: Gamma, Infrared, Microwave, Multifrequency, Radio, Standard, Ultraviolet, Xray.', NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 162586, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 16682210),
('u', 16932, 16132, NULL, NULL, 'This is a standard long-range railgun designed for frigates. Railguns use magnetic rails to fire solid chunks of matter at hypersonic speed. The accurate range of railguns is very good, but due to technical limitations it cannot use onboard guidance. This results in a fairly rapid drop in accuracy at extreme ranges. \n\n\n\nRequires hybrid ammo types: Antimatter, Iridium, Iron, Lead, Plutonium, Thorium, Tungsten, Uranium.', NULL, NULL, 50, NULL, NULL, NULL, 17895.4, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 34287376),
('u', 16932, 16133, NULL, NULL, 'Cruiser-sized large barrel turret. Railguns use magnetic rails to fire solid chunks of matter at hypersonic speed. The accurate range of railguns is very good, but due to technical limitations it cannot use onboard guidance. This results in a fairly rapid drop in accuracy at extreme ranges. \n\n\n\nRequires hybrid ammo types: Antimatter, Iridium, Iron, Lead, Plutonium, Thorium, Tungsten, Uranium.', NULL, NULL, 50, NULL, NULL, NULL, 205079, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 34287377),
('u', 16932, 16134, NULL, NULL, 'The 350mm railgun works much the same as its big brother except that it is considerably faster but also less powerful. The accurate range of railguns is very good, but due to technical limitations it cannot use onboard guidance. This results in a fairly rapid drop in accuracy at extreme ranges. \n\n\n\nRequires hybrid ammo types: Antimatter, Iridium, Iron, Lead, Plutonium, Thorium, Tungsten, Uranium.', NULL, NULL, 50, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1848430, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 34287378),
('u', 518, 16136, NULL, 'CONCORD Standard Missile Launcher', 'Favored by many for its average capacity and firing rate. Useful in both fast attack raids and longer battles.\n\n\n\nMust be loaded with light missiles: Bloodclaw, Flameburst, Piranha, Sabretooth, or their F.O.F variants; Exterminator, Firefly, Seeker, Serpent.\n\n', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4963.84, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 516, 16137, NULL, NULL, 'Designed for long engagements between medium sized ships. Slow firing rate, but makes up for it with a large missile capacity.\n\n\n\nMust fit heavy missiles: Havoc, Scourge, Thunderbolt, Widowmaker or their F.O.F. variants: Eradicator, Hellhound, Hydra, Stalker.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 28647.7, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 516, 16138, NULL, NULL, 'A battleship mounted launcher used for long range standoffs with other battleships, but less suitable for bombardment of deployed structures. Contains a huge missile capacity, but has a slow firing rate and trouble targeting small, fast ships. \n\n\n\nCan only be fitted with cruise missiles: Cataclysm, Devastator, Paradise, Wrath, and their F.O.F. counterparts.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 84873.7, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 512, 16140, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 61744.7, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
