('u', 516, 21573, NULL, NULL, 'These are clever tips to improve the quality of Caldari blueprints received through invention.<br><br>Probability Multiplier: +10% <br>Max. Run Modifier: N/A <br>Mineral Efficiency Modifier: +3 <br>Production Efficiency Modifier: +3\n\n\n\n', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 7487280, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 516, 21574, NULL, NULL, 'Rough outlines for a revolutionary new manufacture technique that improve the production efficiency of Caldari invention jobs considerably.<br><br>Probability Multiplier: +20% <br>Max. Run Modifier: +1 <br>Mineral Efficiency Modifier: +2 <br>Production Efficiency Modifier: +5\n\n\n\n', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 5545010, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 516, 21575, NULL, NULL, 'Solid, if uninspiring, invention techniques, ideal for standard Caldari invention tasks.<br><br> Probability Multiplier: N/A <br>Max. Run Modifier: +2 <br>Mineral Efficiency Modifier: +1 <br>Production Efficiency Modifier: +4\n\n\n\n', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2586570, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 516, 21576, NULL, NULL, 'Intriguing charts that will improve the number of runs of any invented Caldari blueprints a great deal.<br><br> Probability Multiplier: -40% <br> Max. Run Modifier: +9 <br>Mineral Efficiency Modifier: -2 <br>Production Efficiency Modifier: +1\n\n\n\n', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2807840, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 516, 21577, NULL, NULL, 'The guide offers invaluable safe-guards to improve the chance of a successful Caldari invention immensely. Use this decryptor when you\'ve got to get it right.<br><br>Probability Multiplier: +80% <br>Max. Run Modifier: +4 <br>Mineral Efficiency Modifier: -1 <br>Production Efficiency Modifier: +2\n\n\n\n', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 24836800, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 516, 21579, NULL, NULL, 'The Calibration Data gives insightful information into the nature of Minmatar invention jobs, but lacks inspirational touches.<br><br> Probability Multiplier: +10% <br>Max. Run Modifier: N/A <br>Mineral Efficiency Modifier: +3 <br>Production Efficiency Modifier: +3\n\n\n\n', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 5691780, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 516, 21580, NULL, NULL, 'The scientific jargon contained herein could cause mental meltdowns, but if you can extract anything of use it\'s great for Minmatar invention jobs. <br><br> Probability Multiplier: +20% <br>Max. Run Modifier: +1 <br>Mineral Efficiency Modifier: +2 <br>Production Efficiency Modifier: +5\n\n\n\n', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 9263460, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 516, 21581, NULL, NULL, 'As long as you can decipher the theories there is some good common sense stuff in here that can give all around benefits to Minmatar invention jobs.<br><br>Probability Multiplier: N/A <br>Max. Run Modifier: +2 <br>Mineral Efficiency Modifier: +1 <br>Production Efficiency Modifier: +4\n\n\n\n\n\n', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 5924410, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
