('u', 4, 22047, NULL, NULL, 'Outfitted with makeshift sensor arrays and second-hand tactical data analysis equipment, these outposts will, to anyone not in the know, look like useless scrapyards.  Which is exactly what the Matari would have you think.\n\n\n\nThis particular one is being used by several Republic commandos trying to lay low.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
