('u', 17156, 22544, NULL, NULL, 'The Hulk is the largest craft in the second generation of mining vessels created by the ORE Syndicate. Exhumers, like their mining barge cousins, are equipped with electronic subsystems specifically designed to accommodate Strip Mining modules.  They are also far more resilient, better able to handle the dangers of deep space. The Hulk is, bar none, the most efficient mining vessel available.\n\n\n\nMining Barge Skill Bonus:  \n\n3% better yield for Strip Miners per level\n\n7.5% bonus to all shield resistances per level\n\n\n\nExhumers Skill Bonus:  \n\n3% better yield for Strip Miners per level\n\n3% reduction in Ice Harvester duration per level\n\n\n\nRole Bonus:\n\nAble to equip Strip Miner and Ice Harvester turrets', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 8, 189404000, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 16691349),
('u', 17156, 22546, NULL, NULL, 'The Skiff is the smallest of the second generation of mining vessels created by the ORE Syndicate. Exhumers, like their mining barge cousins, are equipped with electronic subsystems specifically designed to accommodate Strip Mining modules. They are also far more resilient, better able to handle the dangers of deep space. Skiffs are specialty vessels, designed to mine Mercoxit.\n\n\n\nMining Barge Skill Bonus:  \n\n3% better yield for Strip Miners per level\n\n7.5% bonus to all shield resistances per level\n\n\n\nExhumers Skill Bonus:  \n\n60% bonus to Mercoxit Mining Crystal yield multiplier per level\n\n20% reduced chance of Mercoxit gas cloud forming per level\n\n\n\nRole Bonus:\n\nAble to equip Strip Miner and Ice Harvester turrets\n\n+2 warp strength', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 8, 52346200, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 16691351),
('u', 17156, 22548, NULL, NULL, 'The Mackinaw is the medium-sized version of the second generation of mining vessels created by the ORE Syndicate. Exhumers, like their mining barge cousins, are equipped with electronic subsystems specifically designed to accommodate Strip Mining modules. They are also far more resilient, better able to handle the dangers of deep space. The Mackinaw is a specialty vessel, ideally suited for ice mining.\n\n\n\nMining Barge Skill Bonus: \n\n3% better yield for Strip Miners per level\n\n7.5% bonus to all shield resistances per level\n\n\n\nExhumers Skill Bonus:  \n\n5% reduction in Ice Harvester duration per level.\n\n\n\nRole Bonus:  \n\n100% bonus Ice Harvester yield but 25% penalty to ice harvester duration\n\nAble to equip Strip Miner and Ice Harvester turrets', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 8, 102670000, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 16691350),
('u', 512, 22551, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 26206200, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 512, 22552, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1900880, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 516, 22553, NULL, NULL, 'Decreases the capacitor need of mining lasers, gas harvesters and ice harvesters.\n\n\n\nForeman Links are dedicated mining operation systems designed to assist foremen in coordinating their operations.\n\nWhile only one of these units can normally be operated at any given time, certain advanced units allow the use of multiple systems. \n\n\n\nNote: The Fleet bonus only works if you are the assigned fleet booster.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 473906, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 512, 22554, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 7767790, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 516, 22555, NULL, NULL, 'Increases the range of the fleet\'s mining lasers, gas harvesters and ice harvesters.\n\n\n\nForeman Links are dedicated mining operation systems designed to assist foremen in coordinating their operations.\n\nWhile only one of these units can normally be operated at any given time, certain advanced units allow the use of multiple systems. \n\n\n\nNote: The Fleet bonus only works if you are the assigned fleet booster.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 473906, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 512, 22556, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 10270700, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 516, 22557, NULL, NULL, 'Decreases mining lasers/ gas harvester and ice harvester duration.\n\n\n\nForeman Links are dedicated mining operation systems designed to assist foremen in coordinating their operations.\n\nWhile only one of these units can normally be operated at any given time, certain advanced units allow the use of multiple systems. \n\n\n\nNote: The Fleet bonus only works if you are the assigned fleet booster.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 473906, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 512, 22558, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 10919700, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 516, 22559, NULL, NULL, 'This advanced interface link drastically improves a commander\'s Mining Foreman ability by directly linking to the mining laser interfaces of all ships in the gang.\n\n\n\nEffect: 50% increase to the command bonus of Mining Foreman Link modules.\n\nReplaces mining foreman skill bonus with fixed 15% mining yield bonus.\n\n', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4464.63, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 516, 22564, NULL, NULL, 'A tiny launcher that can carry a very limited supply of rockets. Not really intended as a primary weapon but rather as a cheap supplementary weapon system.\n\n\n\nMust be loaded with rockets: Foxfire, Gremlin, Phalanx, Thorn.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 83364.8, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 518, 22565, NULL, 'True Sansha Standard Missile Launcher', 'Favored by many for its average capacity and firing rate. Useful in both fast attack raids and longer battles.\n\n\n\nMust be loaded with light missiles: Bloodclaw, Flameburst, Piranha, Sabretooth, or their F.O.F variants; Exterminator, Firefly, Seeker, Serpent.\n\n', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 69493.7, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 518, 22566, NULL, 'True Sansha Assault Missile Launcher', 'Launcher for cruisers intended to counter fast frigates, can only be fitted with regular light missiles: Bloodclaw, Flameburst, Piranha and Sabretooth and their F.O.F. counterparts; Exterminator, Firefly, Seeker and Serpent.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 129188, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 516, 22567, NULL, NULL, 'Designed for long engagements between medium sized ships. Slow firing rate, but makes up for it with a large missile capacity.\n\n\n\nMust fit heavy missiles: Havoc, Scourge, Thunderbolt, Widowmaker or their F.O.F. variants: Eradicator, Hellhound, Hydra, Stalker.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 401068, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 516, 22568, NULL, NULL, 'A battleship mounted launcher used for long range standoffs with other battleships, but less suitable for bombardment of deployed structures. Contains a huge missile capacity, but has a slow firing rate and trouble targeting small, fast ships. \n\n\n\nCan only be fitted with cruise missiles: Cataclysm, Devastator, Paradise, Wrath, and their F.O.F. counterparts.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1188230, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 518, 22569, NULL, 'True Sansha Siege Missile Launcher', 'A massive launcher designed for extended bombardments of hard targets like battleships and stations. Contains a huge missile capacity, but has a slow firing rate and trouble targeting small, fast ships.\n\n\n\nMust be loaded with torpedoes: Bane, Inferno, Juggernaut, Mjolnir.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 569538, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
