('u', 16932, 23773, NULL, NULL, 'The liberty of our people is solely our responsibility.  Tempting as it is to foist this burden upon our well-wishers, we must never forget that the onus of our emancipation rests with us and us alone.\n\n\n\nFor too long, our proud people have been subjugated to the whims of enslavers, forced to endure relentless suffering and humiliation at the hands of people whose motivations, masked though they may be by florid religious claptrap, remain as base and despicable as those of the playground bully.\n\n\n\nIf ever there was a time to rise ', NULL, NULL, 2075620000, NULL, NULL, NULL, 39558400000, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 16680742),
