('u', 518, 24495, NULL, 'Bloodclaw Fury Light Missile', 'Light assault missile. Fresh out of the Minmatar design labs, the Bloodclaw has quickly established itself throughout the galaxy as the ultimate missile for small launchers.\n\n\n\nA modified version of Bloodclaw Light Missile. Does more damage than the Bloodclaw Light Missile but the volatile nature of the warhead, and its powerful containment system, increase the ship\'s electromagnetic footprint when loaded and armed.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 68.7301, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 514, 24496, NULL, 'Bloodclaw Fury Light Missile Blueprint', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 518, 24497, NULL, 'Piranha Fury Light Missile', 'Light assault missile. The Piranha is a tiny nuclear missile based on a classic Minmatar design that has been in use since the early days of the Minmatar Resistance.\n\n\n\nA modified version of Piranha Light Missile. Does more damage than the Piranha Light Missile but the volatile nature of the warhead, and its powerful containment system, increase the ship\'s electromagnetic footprint when loaded and armed.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 64.0586, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
