('u', 518, 24499, NULL, 'Flameburst Fury Light Missile', 'Light assault missile. The explosion the Flameburst missile creates upon impact is stunning enough for any display of fireworks - just ten times more deadly.\n\n\n\nA modified version of Flameburst Light Missile. Does more damage than the Flameburst Light Missile but the volatile nature of the warhead, and its powerful containment system, increase the ship\'s electromagnetic footprint when loaded and armed.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 64.6176, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
