('u', 518, 24503, NULL, 'Piranha Precision Light Missile', 'Light assault missile. The Piranha is a tiny nuclear missile based on a classic Minmatar design that has been in use since the early days of the Minmatar Resistance. \n\n\n\nA modified version of Piranha Light Missile. Is great for taking down smaller ships but the velocity has to be curbed to get a better launch.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 64.0586, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 514, 24504, NULL, 'Piranha Precision Light Missile Blueprint', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 518, 24505, NULL, 'Sabretooth Precision Light Missile', 'Light assault missile. An advanced missile with a volatile payload of magnetized plasma, the Sabretooth is a multi-purpose missile specifically engineered to take down shield systems.\n\n\n\nA modified version of Sabretooth Light Missile. Is great for taking down smaller ships but the velocity has to be curbed to get a better launch.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 66.956, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 514, 24506, NULL, 'Sabretooth Precision Light Missile Blueprint', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 518, 24507, NULL, 'Havoc Fury Heavy Missile', 'The be-all-end-all of medium sized missiles, the Havoc is a must for those who want a guaranteed kill no matter the cost.\n\n\n\nA modified version of Havoc Heavy Missile. Does more damage than the Havoc Heavy Missile but the volatile nature of the warhead, and its powerful containment system, increase the ship\'s electromagnetic footprint when loaded and armed.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 434.917, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 514, 24508, NULL, 'Havoc Fury Heavy Missile Blueprint', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 518, 24509, NULL, 'Thunderbolt Fury Heavy Missile', 'Recently introduced by the armaments lab of the Wiyrkomi Corporation, the Thunderbolt is a solid investment with a large payload and steady performance.\n\n\n\nA modified version of Thunderbolt Heavy Missile. Does more damage than the Thunderbolt Heavy Missile but the volatile nature of the warhead, and its powerful containment system, increase the ship\'s electromagnetic footprint when loaded and armed.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 447.955, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 514, 24510, NULL, 'Thunderbolt Fury Heavy Missile Blueprint', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 518, 24511, NULL, 'Widowmaker Fury Heavy Missile', 'Originally designed as a \'finisher\' - the killing blow to a crippled ship - the Widowmaker has since gone through various technological upgrades. The latest version has a lighter payload than the original, but much improved guidance systems.\n\n\n\nA modified version of Widowmaker Heavy Missile. Does more damage than the Widowmaker Heavy Missile but the volatile nature of the warhead, and its powerful containment system, increase the ship\'s electromagnetic footprint when loaded and armed.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 437.433, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 514, 24512, NULL, 'Widowmaker Fury Heavy Missile Blueprint', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 516, 24513, NULL, NULL, 'The Scourge is an old relic from the Caldari-Gallente War that is still in widespread use because of its low price and versatility.\n\n\n\nA modified version of Scourge Heavy Missile. Is great for taking down smaller ships but the velocity has to be curbed to get a better launch.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 455.939, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 512, 24514, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 518, 24515, NULL, 'Widowmaker Precision Heavy Missile', 'Originally designed as a \'finisher\' - the killing blow to a crippled ship - the Widowmaker has since gone through various technological upgrades. The latest version has a lighter payload than the original, but much improved guidance systems.\n\n\n\nA modified version of Widowmaker Heavy Missile. Is great for taking down smaller ships but the velocity has to be curbed to get a better launch.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 437.433, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 514, 24516, NULL, 'Widowmaker Precision Heavy Missile Blueprint', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 518, 24517, NULL, 'Thunderbolt Precision Heavy Missile', 'Recently introduced by the armaments lab of the Wiyrkomi Corporation, the Thunderbolt is a solid investment with a large payload and steady performance.\n\n\n\nA modified version of Thunderbolt Heavy Missile. Is great for taking down smaller ships but the velocity has to be curbed to get a better launch.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 447.955, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 514, 24518, NULL, 'Thunderbolt Precision Heavy Missile Blueprint', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 518, 24519, NULL, 'Bane Rage Torpedo', 'An ultra-heavy unguided nuclear missile. Slow and dumb but its sheer damage potential is simply staggering.\n\n\n\nThis modified version of the Bane Torpedo packs a considerably stronger punch, but as a result is heavier and slower. This makes it very effective against larger targets, but markedly less effective against smaller and more agile targets. The volatile nature of the warhead, and its powerful containment system, increase the ship\'s electromagnetic footprint when loaded and armed.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1339.16, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 514, 24520, NULL, 'Bane Rage Torpedo Blueprint', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 518, 24521, NULL, 'Juggernaut Rage Torpedo', 'An ultra-heavy piercing missile. Slow and dumb but its sheer damage potential is simply staggering.\n\n\n\nThis modified version of the Juggernaut Torpedo packs a considerably stronger punch, but as a result is heavier and slower. This makes it very effective against larger targets, but markedly less effective against smaller and more agile targets. The volatile nature of the warhead, and its powerful containment system, increase the ship\'s electromagnetic footprint when loaded and armed.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1385.88, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
