('u', 516, 24525, NULL, NULL, 'An ultra-heavy unguided plasma missile. Slow and dumb but its sheer damage potential is simply staggering.\n\n\n\nA modified version of the Inferno Torpedo. It can reach higher velocity than the Inferno Torpedo but needs to reduce the speed of the ship to compensate.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1344.75, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
