('u', 518, 24531, NULL, 'Devastator Fury Cruise Missile', 'Extra heavy assault missile. A very basic missile for large launchers with reasonable payload. Utilizes the now sub-standard technology of bulls-eye guidance system.\n\n\n\nA modified version of the Devastator. Does more damage than the Devastator, but the volatile nature of the warhead, and its powerful containment system, increase the ship\'s electromagnetic footprint when loaded and armed.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 491.402, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 514, 24532, NULL, 'Devastator Fury Cruise Missile Blueprint', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 518, 24533, NULL, 'Wrath Fury Cruise Missile', 'Extra heavy assault missile. The first and only Minmatar-made large missile. Constructed of reactionary alloys, the Wrath is built to get to the target. Guidance and propulsion systems are of Gallentean origin and were initially used in drones, making Wrath fast and nimble despite its heavy payload.\n\n\n\nA modified version of the Wrath. Does more damage than the Wrath but the volatile nature of the warhead, and its powerful containment system, increase the ship\'s electromagnetic footprint when loaded and armed.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 512.424, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 514, 24534, NULL, 'Wrath Fury Cruise Missile Blueprint', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 518, 24535, NULL, 'Paradise Fury Cruise Missile', 'Extra heavy assault missile. The mother of all missiles, the Paradise delivers a tremendous payload, guaranteed to get its victims acquainted with their personal god in a quick, but painful manner.\n\n\n\nA modified version of the Paradise. Does more damage than the Paradise but the volatile nature of the warhead, and its powerful containment system, increase the ship\'s electromagnetic footprint when loaded and armed.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 504.44, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
