('u', 518, 25707, NULL, '\'Arbalest\' Heavy Assault Missile Launcher I', 'A launcher intended for use on cruiser-class spacecraft. While heavy assault launchers do not possess the sheer damage-dealing capability of regular heavy missile launchers, their blend of speed and attack power lends them application across a good range of tactical situations.\n\n\n\nHas to be fitted with regular Assault Missiles: Fulmination, Hellfire, Terror, Torrent.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 743354, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 518, 25709, NULL, '\'Malkuth\' Heavy Assault Missile Launcher I', 'A launcher intended for use on cruiser-class spacecraft. While heavy assault launchers do not possess the sheer damage-dealing capability of regular heavy missile launchers, their blend of speed and attack power lends them application across a good range of tactical situations. \n\n\n\nHas to be fitted with regular Assault Missiles: Fulmination, Hellfire, Terror, Torrent.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 743354, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
