('u', 4, 25809, NULL, NULL, 'The major State outpost in E-8CSQ was recently nicknamed \'Kois City\', in referral to Admiral Aurobe Kois who runs the military operation in the constellation.\n\n\n\nIt is now a bustling hub of activity, \'a beacon of Caldari strength that shines through the unremarkable corner of the galaxy we call E-8CSQ\' (Admiral Aurobe Kois\'s words). ', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
