('u', 4, 26729, NULL, NULL, 'The Matari aren\'t really that high-tech, preferring speed rather then firepower or involved technology. Unfortunately that doesn\'t apply very well to stationary objects, much to the liking of the Amarr Empire.\n\n\n\nAmarrians call it a scrapheap of epic proportions. But don\'t underestimate these structures. Minmatar commanders usually have the last laugh when it comes to combat.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
