('u', 4, 28872, NULL, NULL, 'This mobile laboratory can be moved and anchored with relative ease, and also tailored towards certain specialties which has led many pirate factions using them in places where creating a fully fledged static facility would be a massive liability.\n\n\n\nThis particular one is being used a chemical research laboratory and is liable to contain some useful items for the entrepreneur after a small amount of hacking.\n\n', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
