('u', 4, 29948, NULL, NULL, 'The only known cure for the infamous Vitoc method that Amarrians use to control their massive slave contingents, Insorum is the answer to every loyal Minmatar', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
