('u', 516, 32357, NULL, NULL, 'Representing the latest in miniaturization technology, Compact Citadel Torpedoes are designed specifically to be used by Fighter Bombers.\n\n\n\nNocxium atoms captured in morphite matrices form this missile\'s devastating payload. A volley of these is able to completely obliterate most everything that floats in space, be it vehicle or structure.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2095.69, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 516, 32359, NULL, NULL, 'Representing the latest in miniaturization technology, Compact Citadel Torpedoes are designed specifically to be used by Fighter Bombers.\n\n\n\nPlasma suspended in an electromagnetic field gives this torpedo the ability to deliver a flaming inferno of destruction, wreaking almost unimaginable havoc.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 2967.89, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
('u', 516, 32361, NULL, NULL, 'Representing the latest in miniaturization technology, Compact Citadel Torpedoes are designed specifically to be used by Fighter Bombers.\n\n\n\nFitted with a graviton pulse generator, this weapon causes massive damage as it overwhelms ships\' internal structures, tearing bulkheads and armor plating apart with frightening ease.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 1623.11, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
